<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - April 13.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - April 13.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Sunday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- Prime Minister Karoui chairs meeting of planning committee for approval of final draft of ninth development plan for years 1997-2001.</p>
<p>- National Institute of Statistics says trade between Tunisia and Germany rose 3.1 percent.</p>
<p>LE RENOUVEAU</p>
<p>- Karoui says ninth economic development plan represents determining step in country's development.</p>
</text>
